241
00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:03.660
Tuhu seda mulli.
Sada kilomeetrit tunnis.

242
00:17:06.680 --> 00:17:08.930
Kus ta on?

243
00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.460
Ja mina olen seks abiline.

244
00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.460
Paneme
selle madafuckin battle 'i lukku,

245
00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:09.820
