256
00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:53.970
Rõivatööstus.

257
00:19:54.070 --> 00:19:56.650
Moedrisain.

258
00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:58.930
Rõivatööstus.

259
00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.509
Ja.

260
00:20:00.609 --> 00:20:01.830
